{title: Boondein}
{artist: Silk Route}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F]koi ho, yaado main,        [Dm]palko mein boonde [Bb]liye
[Gm]aaina [C]bani,        yeah [Bb]aakhen [C]teri
[F]dheemi se kushboo hai,        ha [Dm]waoo ke jhooko ne [Bb]jo
[Gm]choo ke [c]tujhe,        [Bb]choorai [C]
[F]sanso ki raho main,        [Dm]kya mil sakenge ka [Bb]bhi
[Gm]dhoonde [C]tujhe,        ni [Bb]gahe [C]meri
[F]sathi the janmo se,        [Dm]raho mein kyu kho [Bb]gaye
[Gm]manzil [C]hame,        bhu [Bb]laane [C]lagi
[F]he hehehehe [Bb]he,        [F]heeeeeee ha [Bb]ha
[F]nagama ho bheega sa,        [Dm]yaa tum ho koi ga [Bb]zal
[Gm]har pal [C]jise,        gungu [Bb]na ta [C]rahu
[F]hoton se, hole se,        [Dm]sargam jo bahene la [Bb]gi
[G]anee [C]lagi [Bb]chaye [C]meri,        [F]he hehehehe [Bb]he
[F]heeeeeee ha [Bb]ha
